#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: disable-dashboard-for-woocommerce.php
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings.php:19
msgid "Disable Bloat for WordPress & WooCommerce"
msgstr "Disable Bloat for WordPress & WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
#: disable-dashboard-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://disablebloat.com/"
msgstr "https://disablebloat.com/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: disable-dashboard-for-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"All-in-One solution to speed up your WordPress & WooCommerce. Remove "
"unnecessary features and make your site faster and cleaner."
msgstr ""
"一站式加速 WordPress 和 WooCommerce 的解决方案。移除不必要的功能，让您的站点"
"更快、更简洁。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: disable-dashboard-for-woocommerce.php
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings.php:10
msgid "Disable Bloat"
msgstr "Disable Bloat"

#: disable-dashboard-for-woocommerce.php:151
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "升级"

#: disable-dashboard-for-woocommerce.php:154
msgid "My Account"
msgstr "我的账户"

#. translators: link to plugin configuration screen
#: includes/functions/disable-bloat-functions_free.php:119
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The WooCommerce Admin module is turned off. The Stripe plugin needs the "
"WooCommerce Admin module to be on when setting up API keys. To do this, "
"please temporarily enable the WooCommerce Admin in the <a "
"href=\"%s\">Disable Bloat plugin settings</a>. You can switch it back off "
"after configuring Stripe API keys."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce Admin 模块已关闭。Stripe 插件在设置 API 密钥时需要开启 "
"WooCommerce Admin 模块。为此，请在 <a href=\"%s\">Disable Bloat 插件设置</a>"
"中临时启用 WooCommerce Admin。配置好 Stripe API 密钥后，您可以再将其关闭。"

#: includes/functions/disable-bloat-review-notice.php:35
msgid "Enjoying Disable Bloat?"
msgstr "喜欢 Disable Bloat 吗？"

#: includes/functions/disable-bloat-review-notice.php:36
msgid ""
"A quick review on WordPress.org helps other site owners find it, and it "
"really makes our day. Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"在 WordPress.org 上留下简短的评价，可以帮助其他站点所有者找到它，也会让我们开"
"心一整天。谢谢！"

#: includes/functions/disable-bloat-review-notice.php:40
msgid "Leave a review"
msgstr "留下评价"

#: includes/functions/disable-bloat-review-notice.php:43
msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "以后再说"

#: includes/functions/disable-bloat-review-notice.php:46
msgid "I already did"
msgstr "我已经评价过了"

#: includes/functions/disable-bloat-review-notice.php:68
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "抱歉，您无权执行此操作。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:22
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings.php:23
msgid "Admin panel optimization"
msgstr "后台面板优化"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:30
msgid "Clean admin interface"
msgstr "简洁的后台界面"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:38
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:226
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:38
msgid "Hide update notice for non-admin users"
msgstr "对非管理员用户隐藏更新通知"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:52
msgid "Disable Autosave"
msgstr "禁用自动保存"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:69
msgid "Notices from other plugins"
msgstr "来自其他插件的通知"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:70
msgid "Hide admin notices from other plugins and themes"
msgstr "隐藏来自其他插件和主题的后台通知"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:71
msgid ""
"Removes the banners, nags and promotions that other plugins and your theme "
"add to the top of admin screens. Notices from WordPress itself (such as "
"update and error messages), from WooCommerce and from Disable Bloat stay "
"visible, and so do notices that contain one of the words below."
msgstr ""
"移除其他插件和主题在后台页面顶部添加的横幅、提醒和推广信息。来自 WordPress 本"
"身（例如更新和错误消息）、WooCommerce 以及 Disable Bloat 的通知会保持可见，包"
"含下列任一词语的通知也会保持可见。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:77
msgid "Always show notices containing"
msgstr "始终显示包含以下内容的通知"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:91
msgid "Disable WordPress Dashboard widgets"
msgstr "禁用 WordPress 仪表盘小工具"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:105
msgid "WordPress logo in the admin bar"
msgstr "工具栏中的 WordPress 徽标"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:119
msgid "Admin footer text"
msgstr "后台页脚文字"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:133
msgid "WordPress login page"
msgstr "WordPress 登录页面"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:141
msgid "Hide WordPress logo on the Login Page"
msgstr "在登录页面隐藏 WordPress 徽标"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:155
msgid "Change the Logo Link"
msgstr "更改徽标链接"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:169
msgid "Change the Logo title parameter"
msgstr "更改徽标 title 参数"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:183
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:391
msgid "Disable WordPress Login Language Switcher"
msgstr "禁用 WordPress 登录页语言切换器"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:210
msgid ""
"By default, the WordPress admin panel is cluttered with preinstalled "
"elements that may distract you from your work. You can simplify your "
"WordPress admin panel by hiding or turning them off."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，WordPress 后台面板中充斥着各种预装元素，可能会分散您的注意力。您"
"可以通过隐藏或关闭这些元素来简化 WordPress 后台面板。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:217
msgid ""
"If you love a simple and flexible interface, use the options below to "
"maximize your performance while browsing through the WordPress admin panel. "
"By removing unnecessary elements, you will be 100% focused on your tasks."
msgstr ""
"如果您喜欢简洁灵活的界面，请使用下面的选项，在浏览 WordPress 后台面板时获得最"
"佳性能。移除不必要的元素后，您可以 100% 专注于手头的任务。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:227
msgid ""
"The next time any user with the Role set as Subscriber, Contributor, Author, "
"or Editor access the WordPress back-end, they will not be prompted to update "
"the WordPress core. The notification will continue to display for admin "
"users."
msgstr ""
"此后，角色为订阅者、投稿者、作者或编辑的用户访问 WordPress 后台时，将不会再收"
"到更新 WordPress 核心的提示。管理员用户仍会看到该通知。"

#. translators: %s: default keyword list
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:240
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Comma-separated words. A notice from another plugin stays visible when its "
"text contains one of them (not case-sensitive, and part of a word counts: "
"<code>payment</code> also matches \"WooPayments\"), so important messages "
"such as \"Settings saved\" or a failed payment are not hidden. Default: "
"<code>%s</code>. Leave empty to hide all notices from other plugins."
msgstr ""
"以英文逗号分隔的词语。当来自其他插件的通知文本中包含其中任一词语时，该通知将"
"保持可见（不区分大小写，且匹配部分词语：<code>payment</code> 也会匹"
"配“WooPayments”），这样诸如“设置已保存”或付款失败之类的重要消息就不会被隐藏。"
"默认值：<code>%s</code>。留空则隐藏来自其他插件的所有通知。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:251
msgid "Disable WordPress editor Autosave feature"
msgstr "禁用 WordPress 编辑器自动保存功能"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:252
msgid ""
"WordPress saves everything you write on the editor after an interval of 60 "
"seconds. It can use excessive server resources and may cause performance "
"issues. Enabling this option will turn off the autosave feature."
msgstr ""
"WordPress 会每隔 60 秒自动保存您在编辑器中撰写的所有内容。这可能会占用过多的"
"服务器资源并导致性能问题。启用此选项将关闭自动保存功能。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:265
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:560
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:418
msgid "Select / Deselect All"
msgstr "全选 / 取消全选"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:274
msgid "Site Health Status"
msgstr "站点健康状态"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:279
msgid "At a Glance"
msgstr "概览"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:286
msgid "Activity"
msgstr "活动"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:291
msgid "Quick Draft"
msgstr "快速草稿"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:298
msgid "WordPress Events and News"
msgstr "WordPress 活动及新闻"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:303
msgid "Welcome panel"
msgstr "欢迎面板"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:308
msgid ""
"WordPress by default comes with a lot of Dashboard widgets installed. They "
"often are not used at all, but can add backend load and front-end load. "
"Choose which of the WordPress Dashboard Widgets should be disabled. The "
"<strong>ones you choose will be disabled</strong>, and the <strong>ones that "
"had not been selected</strong> will stay <strong>active</strong>."
msgstr ""
"WordPress 默认安装了许多仪表盘小工具。这些小工具通常根本用不到，却会增加后台"
"和前台的负载。请选择要禁用哪些 WordPress 仪表盘小工具。<strong>您选中的小工具"
"将被禁用</strong>，<strong>未选中的小工具</strong>将保持<strong>启用</"
"strong>。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:320
msgid "Remove the WordPress logo (“W”) from the admin bar"
msgstr "从工具栏中移除 WordPress 徽标（“W”）"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:322
msgid ""
"This option will hide the WordPress logo in the upper left corner. The logo "
"won't be visible in your admin panel and in your site (on the admin bar "
"visible on the front-end after logging in)."
msgstr ""
"此选项将隐藏左上角的 WordPress 徽标。该徽标将不会出现在您的后台面板和站点中"
"（即登录后在前台显示的工具栏上）。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:333
msgid "Remove admin footer text"
msgstr "移除后台页脚文字"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:335
msgid ""
"This option hides the text at the bottom of the WordPress admin: <code>Thank "
"you for creating with WordPress</code> on the bottom left, and the WordPress "
"version on the bottom right."
msgstr ""
"此选项将隐藏 WordPress 后台底部的文字：左下角的 <code>Thank you for creating "
"with WordPress</code> 以及右下角的 WordPress 版本号。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:342
msgid ""
"There are situations when you may prefer to hide or change the standard "
"WordPress branding on the Login Page."
msgstr ""
"在某些情况下，您可能希望隐藏或更改登录页面上的标准 WordPress 品牌标识。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:352
msgid "Hide WordPress logo on the WordPress Login Page"
msgstr "在 WordPress 登录页面隐藏 WordPress 徽标"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:354
msgid "Hide standard WordPress Logo from Login Page"
msgstr "在登录页面隐藏标准 WordPress 徽标"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:365
msgid "Change the Logo Link on the WordPress Login Page"
msgstr "更改 WordPress 登录页面上的徽标链接"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:367
msgid ""
"By default, the WordPress login page displays the WordPress logo which is "
"linking to WordPress.org site. After activating this option, the logo on the "
"login page will be linking to your site's homepage."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，WordPress 登录页面显示的 WordPress 徽标链接到 WordPress.org 网"
"站。启用此选项后，登录页面上的徽标将链接到您站点的首页。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:378
msgid "Change the Logo title parameter on the WordPress Login Page"
msgstr "更改 WordPress 登录页面上的徽标 title 参数"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:380
msgid ""
"By default, the WordPress Logo displayed on the WordPress Login Page has a "
"title parameter that says <code>Powered by WordPress</code>. After "
"activating this option, it will match your Site Name."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，WordPress 登录页面上显示的 WordPress 徽标带有内容为 "
"<code>Powered by WordPress</code> 的 title 参数。启用此选项后，它将与您的站点"
"名称一致。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-admin.php:393
msgid ""
"This option will disable the language selector which allows users to switch "
"languages from a dropdown on the login screen if more than one language is "
"enabled on your WordPress installation."
msgstr ""
"如果您的 WordPress 安装启用了多种语言，登录页面上会显示一个下拉式语言选择器供"
"用户切换语言。此选项将禁用该语言选择器。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:22
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings.php:26
msgid "Block Editor"
msgstr "区块编辑器"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:30
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:171
msgid "Disable Gutenberg"
msgstr "禁用 Gutenberg"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:52
msgid "Disable Gutenberg features"
msgstr "禁用 Gutenberg 功能"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:60
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:188
msgid "Disable Gutenberg Widget Block Editor"
msgstr "禁用 Gutenberg 小工具区块编辑器"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:74
msgid "Welcome Guide"
msgstr "欢迎指南"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:88
msgid "WordPress Block Directory"
msgstr "WordPress 区块目录"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:102
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:226
msgid "Remove the default block patterns"
msgstr "移除默认区块样板"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:116
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:239
msgid "Auto-exit the Fullscreen Mode on editor load"
msgstr "加载编辑器时自动退出全屏模式"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:130
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:252
msgid "Deactivate the Template Editor"
msgstr "停用模板编辑器"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:156
msgid ""
"Using Block Editor can significantly slow down your page during editing "
"posts and while browsing through your site. You can decide to either turn "
"Gutenberg (WordPress built-in Block Editor) off completely or keep it on and "
"only disable unnecessary features.<hr>"
msgstr ""
"使用区块编辑器可能会显著拖慢编辑文章以及浏览站点时的页面速度。您可以选择完全"
"关闭 Gutenberg（WordPress 内置的区块编辑器），或者保持开启并仅禁用不必要的功"
"能。<hr>"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:162
msgid ""
"By enabling this option, you will turn off Gutenberg Block Editor for all "
"supported post types (including pages). All Gutenberg action and filter "
"hooks will be deactivated, and Gutenberg frontend scripts won’t load on your "
"site too."
msgstr ""
"启用此选项后，将为所有受支持的文章类型（包括页面）关闭 Gutenberg 区块编辑器。"
"所有 Gutenberg 动作和过滤器钩子都将被停用，Gutenberg 前端脚本也不会在您的站点"
"上加载。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:172
msgid ""
"By enabling this option, you will turn off Gutenberg Block Editor for all "
"supported post types (including pages). All Gutenberg action and filter "
"hooks will be deactivated, and Gutenberg frontend scripts won't load on your "
"site too."
msgstr ""
"启用此选项后，将为所有受支持的文章类型（包括页面）关闭 Gutenberg 区块编辑器。"
"所有 Gutenberg 动作和过滤器钩子都将被停用，Gutenberg 前端脚本也不会在您的站点"
"上加载。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:179
msgid ""
"If you decide to keep Gutenberg on, you can at least maximize your "
"experience by tweaking its features to match your needs."
msgstr ""
"如果您决定保留 Gutenberg，至少可以调整其功能以满足您的需求，从而获得最佳体"
"验。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:189
msgid ""
"Check this option to disable the new widget block editor page. By doing so, "
"you'll restore the familiar \"classic\" WordPress widgets screen and "
"deactivate the block editor's widget management functionality. This allows "
"you to continue managing widgets in the traditional way, providing a more "
"familiar and comfortable experience for users used to the classic widget "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"勾选此选项可禁用新的小工具区块编辑器页面。这样将恢复熟悉的“经典”WordPress 小"
"工具界面，并停用区块编辑器的小工具管理功能。您可以继续以传统方式管理小工具，"
"为习惯经典小工具界面的用户提供更熟悉、更舒适的体验。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:200
msgid "Auto-close Welcome Guide"
msgstr "自动关闭欢迎指南"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:202
msgid ""
"Turn off the annoying pop-up Welcome Guide Modal. Users will still be able "
"to open it manually via the context menu."
msgstr "关闭烦人的欢迎指南弹出窗口。用户仍可通过上下文菜单手动打开它。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:213
msgid "Disable WordPress Block Directory"
msgstr "禁用 WordPress 区块目录"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:215
msgid ""
"As Blocks are in fact plugins, it's a potential security threat to use Block "
"Directory. New Blocks are added to the Directory automatically, without "
"human review."
msgstr ""
"由于区块实际上就是插件，使用区块目录存在潜在的安全威胁。新区块会被自动添加到"
"目录中，未经人工审核。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:228
msgid ""
"Patterns is a feature in the Block editor that lets you save and reuse "
"patterns of many blocks. It is similar to reusable blocks, but they are not "
"global by default."
msgstr ""
"样板是区块编辑器中的一项功能，可让您保存并重复使用由多个区块组成的样板。它与"
"可重用区块类似，但默认不是全局的。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:241
msgid "Users will still be able to enter it manually via the context menu."
msgstr "用户仍可通过上下文菜单手动进入。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-block.php:254
msgid ""
"The Template Editor allows users to edit their theme's templates from within "
"the Block Editor. Only applies to classic themes: block themes need the "
"Template Editor to display your site, so this setting is ignored when a "
"block theme is active."
msgstr ""
"模板编辑器允许用户在区块编辑器中编辑主题的模板。仅适用于经典主题：区块主题需"
"要模板编辑器来显示您的站点，因此启用区块主题时将忽略此设置。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:21
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Bloat"
msgstr "Disable WooCommerce Bloat"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:29
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:37
msgid "WooCommerce Admin"
msgstr "WooCommerce Admin"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:51
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Admin features"
msgstr "禁用 WooCommerce Admin 功能"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:68
msgid "Marketing Hub"
msgstr "营销中心"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:82
msgid "WooCommerce promotions"
msgstr "WooCommerce 推广"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:90
msgid "WooCommerce.com notice"
msgstr "WooCommerce.com通知"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:104
msgid "Marketplace Suggestions"
msgstr "市场建议"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:118
msgid "Extensions & My Subscriptions submenus"
msgstr "“扩展”和“我的订阅”子菜单"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:132
msgid "Recommended shipping solutions metabox"
msgstr "推荐配送解决方案元框"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:146
msgid "Recommended payments solutions metabox"
msgstr "推荐付款解决方案元框"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:160
msgid "Hide marketplace link on the Payments Settings screen"
