msgstr "“付款”菜单"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:177
msgid "Remove the top-level \"Payments\" menu item"
msgstr "移除顶级“付款”菜单项"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:178
msgid ""
"Recent WooCommerce versions add a \"Payments\" item to the main admin menu "
"that promotes WooPayments, sometimes with a notification badge. It only "
"links to WooCommerce > Settings > Payments, which stays available. When "
"WooPayments is set up, its own Payments menu is kept."
msgstr ""
"较新版本的 WooCommerce 会在后台主菜单中添加一个推广 WooPayments 的“付款”菜单"
"项，有时还带有通知徽章。它仅链接到 WooCommerce > 设置 > 付款，该页面仍然可以"
"访问。如果已设置 WooPayments，则会保留其自身的“付款”菜单。"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:184
msgid "WooCommerce emails"
msgstr "WooCommerce 电子邮件"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:192
